{
  "capitulo": 7,
  "titulo_es": "Ya había salido",
  "titulo": { "en": "She had already left" },
  "intro": { "en": "The pluscuamperfecto is a past before another past." },
  "palabras": {
    "había": { "en": "I had, he/she had (auxiliary)", "pron": "a-BI-a", "cat": "verb" },
    "habías": { "en": "you had (auxiliary)", "pron": "a-BI-as", "cat": "verb" },
    "salido": { "en": "left, gone out", "pron": "sa-LI-do", "cat": "participle" },
    "llamado": { "en": "called", "pron": "ya-MA-do", "cat": "participle" },
    "visto": { "en": "seen", "pron": "BIS-to", "cat": "participle" },
    "cuando llegué": { "en": "when I arrived", "pron": "KWAN-do ye-GE", "cat": "expression" },
    "ya": { "en": "already", "pron": "ya", "cat": "adverb" },
    "antes": { "en": "before", "pron": "AN-tes", "cat": "adverb" }
  },
  "bloques": [
    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": "Earlier than another past",
      "texto": "**Había** + participle sits further back than the indefinido.\n\n- Cuando **llegué**, Ana ya **había salido**.\n\nThe arrival is the indefinido. The leaving happened before that.\n\n**Había** is the same for yo and for él/ella. Tú is **habías**."
    },
    {
      "tipo": "dialogo",
      "titulo": "Too late",
      "frases": [
        {
          "quien": "Lucía",
          "es": "Cuando llegué, Ana ya había salido.",
          "en": "When I arrived, Ana had already left.",
          "analisis": [
            ["Cuando llegué", "the later past"],
            ["ya había salido", "the earlier past"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Pablo",
          "es": "¿Habías llamado antes?",
          "en": "Had you called beforehand?",
          "analisis": [
            ["¿Habías llamado", "verb"],
            ["antes", "before"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Lucía",
          "es": "Sí, había llamado a las tres.",
          "en": "Yes, I had called at three.",
          "analisis": [
            ["había llamado", "verb"],
            ["a las tres", "time"]
          ]
        },
        {
          "quien": "Pablo",
          "es": "Yo no había visto el mensaje.",
          "en": "I hadn't seen the message.",
          "analisis": [
            ["no había visto", "negation"],
            ["el mensaje", "object"]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tipo": "vocabulario",
      "palabras": ["había", "habías", "salido", "llamado", "visto", "cuando llegué", "ya", "antes"]
    },
    {
      "tipo": "huecos",
      "id": "b1-plus-habia",
      "pregunta": { "en": "Complete: Ana had already left." },
      "frase": "Ana ya ___ salido.",
      "audio": true,
      "opciones": {
        "había": { "en": "Había plus the participle is the earlier past." },
        "ha": { "en": "Ha is the present perfect, linked to now." },
        "estuvo": { "en": "Estuvo does not take a participle here." }
      },
      "correcta": "había"
    },
    {
      "tipo": "ordenar",
      "id": "b1-plus-llegue",
      "frase": "Cuando llegué, Ana ya había salido",
